OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FFine during
OL,6,Fthe evening and overnight, with clear
OL,7,Fperiods. Becoming breezier in southern
OL,8,Fcoastal districts towards dawn, with a
OL,9,Flittle more cloud here. Temperatures
OL,10,Fgenerally near average.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FFine during the morning with
OL,13,Fsome warm sunny spells. Becoming
OL,14,Fbreezier and cloudier through the
OL,15,Fafternoon, although rain probably
OL,16,Fholding off until the overnight period.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
