OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FRather
OL,6,Fcloudy with some rain Sunday, easing
OL,7,Flater to brighter spells. Staying
OL,8,Fchangeable into the new working week.
OL,9,FTurning quite warm, although tempered
OL,10,Fby spells of rain and the breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
